<!doctype html><html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Get to know the ideas and approach behind BrightStart, a demo creative studio."><title>Our story | BrightStart</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= request.getContextPath() %>/style.css"></head>
<body>
<%@ include file="WEB-INF/fragments/header.jspf" %>
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="container page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE PIXELS</p><h1>Good work starts<br>with <span class="highlight">good people.</span></h1><p class="intro">We're a small creative studio with a simple belief: every business deserves a thoughtful beginning.</p></section>
  <section class="container story-grid"><div class="story-art"><span class="large-spark" aria-hidden="true">&#10038;</span><p>Stay curious.<br>Keep it simple.<br><em>Make it matter.</em></p><span class="eyebrow">THE BRIGHTSTART WAY</span></div><div class="story-copy"><p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</p><h2>Small by choice.<br>Personal by nature.</h2><p>BrightStart is a fictional studio created around the joy of bringing an idea to life. We imagine working with the neighborhood cafe, the independent maker, and the new business ready to introduce itself.</p><p>Our approach begins with listening. We make space for your questions, explain our choices, and turn a big project into a series of manageable steps.</p><p>These pages are a demonstration of that approach: clear words, useful details, and a little personality at every turn.</p><a class="text-link" href="contact.jsp">Let's hear your story &#8599;</a></div></section>
  <section class="container section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT GUIDES OUR WORK</p><h2>Simple values.<br>Better experiences.</h2></div><p>The details matter. So does the way we work together.</p></div><div class="service-grid"><article class="service-card"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9678;</span><h3>Clarity over clutter</h3><p>Give every word and every element a reason to be there. Help people find what they need without thinking twice.</p></article><article class="service-card"><span class="service-icon peach" aria-hidden="true">&#9825;</span><h3>A human approach</h3><p>Speak plainly, ask thoughtful questions, and make room for different perspectives. Good collaboration feels comfortable.</p></article><article class="service-card"><span class="service-icon lilac" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span><h3>Progress with purpose</h3><p>Start with what matters today. Build a foundation that gives your business room to change and grow.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="faq-section"><div class="container section faq-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS YOU MIGHT WONDER</p><h2>Good questions.<br>Clear answers.</h2><p>Still curious? <a class="text-link" href="contact.jsp">Ask us directly &#8599;</a></p></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>What kinds of projects are shown here?</summary><p>This is a demo website for a fictional creative studio. The portfolio shows original fictional concepts, rather than real client projects.</p></details><details><summary>Does the contact form actually work?</summary><p>Yes, it validates your details using Java and shows a confirmation. This demo does not save messages or send email.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use this as my own business website?</summary><p>You can personalize the pages, replace the example contact details, and connect a real message service before using it for your business.</p></details><details><summary>Will the website work on my phone?</summary><p>The layout adapts to small screens, with a mobile menu, stacked cards, and a contact form designed for touch.</p></details></div></div></section>
  <section class="container cta-banner"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FRESH PERSPECTIVE CAN GO A LONG WAY</p><h2>What's your<br>next chapter?</h2></div><a class="button button-light" href="contact.jsp#contact-form">Tell us about it &#8599;</a><span class="cta-spark" aria-hidden="true">&#10038;</span></section>
<section class="container services"><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE COLLABORATE</p><h2>A clear process, from start to finish.</h2><div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><h3>Understand</h3><p>Start with your audience and the purpose of your project.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Explore</h3><p>Sketch directions and choose a visual language together.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Create</h3><p>Build pages and refine the content with your feedback.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Launch</h3><p>Review the experience and prepare a clear handover.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="container cta"><h2>Let's turn a conversation into a beginning.</h2><a class="button" href="contact.jsp">Say hello &#8599;</a></section>
</main>
<%@ include file="WEB-INF/fragments/footer.jspf" %>
</body></html>
